{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788164688459,"sessionID":"ses_fa9158e51ffe06kpEfMXBMQYJc","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_L3EWgh3N6xgAGa6bH7DQ3Mzd","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/out/interface_fix_report.md"},"output":"<path>/workspace/out/interface_fix_report.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Interface Fix Report\n2: \n3: ## Root Cause\n4: \n5: `catalog` now exposes a product's price as `product.price`, a `Money` object whose fields are `amount_cents` and `currency`. `orders.adapter` still read the removed `product.price_cents` and top-level `product.currency` attributes, so current catalog products could not be priced. The adapter also needed to continue accepting legacy dictionaries with `price_cents`.\n6: \n7: ## Changed Files\n8: \n9: - `packages/orders/orders/adapter.py`: read `Money.amount_cents` and `Money.currency` for current products, while retaining the legacy dictionary path.\n10: - `packages/orders/orders/service.py`: preserve mixed-currency rejection and include both currencies in the error for clarity.\n11: \n12: The `catalog` `Money` model and the reports aggregation contract were left unchanged.\n13: \n14: ## Verification\n15: \n16: Requested command:\n17: \n18: ```text\n19: python -m pytest tests\n20: ```\n21: \n22: It could not run in this environment because `python` is unavailable. The equivalent `python3 -m pytest tests` also could not run because `pytest` is not installed. A direct `python3` integration check with `PYTHONPATH=packages/catalog:packages/orders:packages/reports` passed for current `Money` products, legacy dictionaries, per-currency reports, and mixed-currency rejection.\n\n(End of file - total 22 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Interface Fix Report\n\n## Root Cause\n\n`catalog` now exposes a product's price as `product.price`, a `Money` object whose fields are `amount_cents` and `currency`. `orders.adapter` still read the removed `product.price_cents` and top-level `product.currency` attributes, so current catalog products could not be priced. The adapter also needed to continue accepting legacy dictionaries with `price_cents`.\n\n## Changed Files\n\n- `packages/orders/orders/adapter.py`: read `Money.amount_cents` and `Money.currency` for current products, while retaining the legacy dictionary path.\n- `packages/orders/orders/service.py`: preserve mixed-currency rejection and include both currencies in the error for clarity.\n\nThe `catalog` `Money` model and the reports aggregation contract were left unchanged.\n\n## Verification\n\nRequested command:\n\n```text\npython -m pytest tests\n```","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/out/interface_fix_report.md","text":"# Interface Fix Report\n\n## Root Cause\n\n`catalog` now exposes a product's price as `product.price`, a `Money` object whose fields are `amount_cents` and `currency`. `orders.adapter` still read the removed `product.price_cents` and top-level `product.currency` attributes, so current catalog products could not be priced. The adapter also needed to continue accepting legacy dictionaries with `price_cents`.\n\n## Changed Files\n\n- `packages/orders/orders/adapter.py`: read `Money.amount_cents` and `Money.currency` for current products, while retaining the legacy dictionary path.\n- `packages/orders/orders/service.py`: preserve mixed-currency rejection and include both currencies in the error for clarity.\n\nThe `catalog` `Money` model and the reports aggregation contract were left unchanged.\n\n## Verification\n\nRequested command:\n\n```text\npython -m pytest tests\n```\n\nIt could not run in this environment because `python` is unavailable. The equivalent `python3 -m pytest tests` also could not run because `pytest` is not installed. A direct `python3` integration check with `PYTHONPATH=packages/catalog:packages/orders:packages/reports` passed for current `Money` products, legacy dictionaries, per-currency reports, and mixed-currency rejection.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":22,"totalLines":22,"truncated":false}},"title":"workspace/out/interface_fix_report.md","time":{"start":1788164688424,"end":1788164688458}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0ff6bb1d4ab12fea016a953a503ff087d2b0c8030af96a2379"}},"id":"prt_056ebca20001bqUZyaRSizfsPu","sessionID":"ses_fa9158e51ffe06kpEfMXBMQYJc","messageID":"msg_056ebad0c001p0F0EtQ05vlriP"}}
